1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,890
Online classes have become an important part of university education.
网课已经成为大学教育的重要组成部分。

2
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:16,060
In my opinion, they have both clear advantages and obvious disadvantages, and they can be improved in several ways.
在我看来，网课既有明显的优点，也有明显的缺点，并且可以从几个方面加以改进。

3
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:20,850
On the one hand, online classes are flexible and convenient.
一方面，网课灵活又方便。

4
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:29,030
Students can attend them from anywhere, and recorded lectures allow them to review difficult points as many times as they need.
学生在任何地方都能上课，录播课程还能让他们根据需要反复复习难点。

5
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:35,180
Online platforms also give students access to excellent courses from other universities.
网络平台还让学生能够接触到其他大学的优秀课程。

6
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:39,260
On the other hand, online classes have their limits.
另一方面，网课也有其局限性。

7
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:48,430
Without face-to-face contact, students may find it hard to concentrate, and teachers cannot easily tell whether students understand the lesson.
没有面对面的交流，学生可能会觉得难以集中注意力，老师也不容易判断学生是否听懂了课。

8
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:53,470
Moreover, a poor internet connection can interrupt a class at any moment.
此外，网络连接不畅随时都可能打断课堂。

9
00:00:54,270 --> 00:01:03,430
To make online classes more effective, teachers could add more interaction, such as short quizzes, group discussions and live question-and-answer sessions.
为了让网课更有成效，老师可以增加更多互动，比如小测验、小组讨论和直播问答环节。

10
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:09,490
Universities should also improve their online platforms and provide technical support.
大学也应该改进其网络平台，并提供技术支持。

11
00:01:10,290 --> 00:01:14,490
As for students, they need to manage their time well and stay focused.
至于学生，他们需要合理安排时间，保持专注。

12
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:21,060
If these steps are taken, online classes can be a valuable complement to traditional teaching.
如果采取这些措施，网课就能成为传统教学的宝贵补充。
